<header class="ref-head yr-head"><p class="cty-kicker">Year by year · <a href="/centuries/20th-century">20th century</a></p><h1 class="research-title">1930</h1><p class="ref-lede">1930 in world history: 38 events, 15 births, 20 deaths, 2 works, 3 states founded and 5 that came to an end. 724 recorded states existed that year.</p></header>
