<section><h2 class="ref-sec-title">In the profiles</h2><ul class="yr-prof"><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/empire/argentine-republic"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Argentine%20Republic.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Argentine Republic</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">General José Félix Uriburu overthrows Hipólito Yrigoyen in the first military coup</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/empire/british-raj"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/British%20Raj.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>British Raj</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">Gandhi leads the Salt March to Dandi</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/empire/french-indochina"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/French%20Indochina.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>French Indochina</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">The Indochinese Communist Party is founded and the Yen Bai mutiny is crushed</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/empire/liberia"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Liberia.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Liberia</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">A forced labour scandal forces President Charles King to resign</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/language/swahili"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Swahili.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Swahili</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">A committee of the British East African territories standardises Swahili on the dialect of Zanzibar</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/movement/indian-independence-movement"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Indian%20independence%20movement.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Indian independence movement</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">Gandhi’s Salt March to Dandi begins a nationwide campaign of civil disobedience</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/culture/ubaid-culture"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Ubaid%20culture.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Ubaid culture</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">A conference in Baghdad defines the ‘Ubaid pottery style’</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/movement/bauhaus"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Bauhaus.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Bauhaus</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">The mayor of Dessau, Fritz Hesse, dismisses Meyer, and Ludwig Mies van der Rohe takes over</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/life/mahatma-gandhi"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Mahatma%20Gandhi.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Mahatma Gandhi</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">He leads the Salt March from Ahmedabad to Dandi to break the British salt laws</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/life/haile-selassie"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Haile%20Selassie.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Haile Selassie</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">Following the death of Empress Zewditu he is crowned emperor on 2 November at the Cathedral of St. George in Addis Ababa, taking the regnal name Haile Selassie I</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/life/ho-chi-minh"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Ho%20Chi%20Minh.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Ho Chi Minh</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">Chairs the meeting in Hong Kong that unites two Vietnamese communist parties and founds the Indochinese Communist Party</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/city/constantinople"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Constantinople.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Constantinople</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">Turkey's government urges other countries to use the name Istanbul</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/city/persepolis"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Persepolis.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Persepolis</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">Ernst Herzfeld and Erich Schmidt begin the first scientific excavations</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/work/great-mosque-of-djenne"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Great%20Mosque%20of%20Djenn%C3%A9.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Great Mosque of Djenné</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">An inexact replica, the Missiri mosque, was built in cement at Fréjus in southern France</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/life/sukarno"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Sukarno.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Sukarno</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">At his trial in Bandung he delivers the speeches published as Indonesia Accuses and is sentenced to four years in prison</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/movement/mau-movement"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Mau%20movement.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Mau movement</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">A truce is declared on 12 March, with the male Mau members keeping their right to non-cooperation</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/ideology/stalinism"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Stalinism.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Stalinism</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">The Soviet famine of 1930–1933 begins during forced collectivisation, and the Holodomor follows near the end of 1932</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/ideology/three-principles-of-the-people"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Three%20Principles%20of%20the%20People.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Three Principles of the People</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">Sun's Whampoa address, whose opening line invokes the Principles, becomes the Kuomintang's party anthem</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/ideology/gandhism"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Gandhism.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Gandhism</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">Gandhi and his supporters march from Ahmedabad to Dandi in Gujarat in defiance of the salt monopoly</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/religion/rastafari"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Rastafari.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Rastafari</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">Haile Selassie is crowned Emperor of Ethiopia, and several Jamaican clergymen claim that it fulfils biblical prophecy and shows that he is a black messiah</span></li></ul></section>
